{"strongs": "H0917", "word": "בְּדָן", "translit": "be.dan", "root": "בדן", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Bedan", "definition": "בְּדָן proper name, masculine (= עַבְדָּן ?). 1. a judge of Israel 1Sam 12:11 but rd probably בָּרָק , so ᵐ5 ᵑ6 We , compare Dr (see Judg 4:6 f.). 2. a Manassite 1Chr 7:17 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB924')\">BDB924</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H917')\">H917</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB923')\">BDB923</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB925')\">BDB925</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בְּדָן</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (= <bdbheb>עַבְדָּן</bdbheb> ?). <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a judge of Israel <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:11\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,11)\">1Sam 12:11</ref> but rd probably <bdbheb>בָּרָק</bdbheb>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> (see <ref ref=\"Judg 4:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,6)\">Judg 4:6</ref>f.). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a Manassite <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,17)\">1Chr 7:17</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Sam 12:11", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 12, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Judg 4:6", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "1Chr 7:17", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 7, "verse": 17}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["בְּדָן", "עַבְדָּן", "בָּרָק", "ᵐ5", "ᵑ6"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Dr", "Sept", "Syr", "We"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB924", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}